## 1. GET all tasks
GET http://localhost:3000/api/resources

### 2. POST a new task (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Connect API to MongoDB",
  "status": "in-progress"
}

### 3. POST with no title (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

### 4. GET one task
GET http://localhost:3000/api/resources/6af15a5f4cc53ff9e10390ca

### 5. GET an id that does not exist (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/resources/64b000000000000000000000

### 6. PUT update the status
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/resources/6af15a5f4cc53ff9e10390ca
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "done"
}

### 7. DELETE the task
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/resources/6af15a5f4cc53ff9e10390ca

### 8. GET the deleted task (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/resources/6af15a5f4cc53ff9e10390ca
